  "bodyHash": "4x8oLn29koQ=",
  "content": "<p>FTB Library 是 FTB 模组的核心基础组件，旨在简化和提升我们开发者的模组制作体验，优化 Feed the Beast 生态系统中模组的开发流程。虽然它主要供 FTB Chunks 和 FTB Quests 等 FTB 模组使用，但并未明确禁止非 FTB 模组集成。不过请注意，在此类场景中使用可能面临挑战，由此产生的任何问题需由模组开发者自行负责解决。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/supports-forge.webp?v=1\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/supports-neoforge.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/requires-arch.webp?v=1\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><strong>搭配使用</strong></h4><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-chunks-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/pairs-with-chunks.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-teams-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/pairs-with-teams.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-quests-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/pairs-with-quests.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-essentials-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/pairs-with-essentials.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h3><strong>主要特点</strong></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li><strong>简化GUI开发</strong>：FTB Library 提供结构化的GUI开发框架，使我们能够增强FTB模组套件的用户体验。</li>\n<li><strong>侧边栏系统</strong>：FTB Library 在物品栏界面左上角引入便捷的侧边栏系统，提供快速访问核心功能。</li>\n<li><strong>配置库</strong>：通过FTB Library内置的配置库轻松管理模组设置，让自定义游戏体验变得简单。</li>\n<li><strong>SNBT系统</strong>：FTB Library 包含SNBT（字符串命名二进制标签）系统，简化模组中的数据存储与操作，确保顺畅集成与兼容性。</li>\n<li><strong>基于SNBT的配置系统</strong>：利用基于SNBT的配置系统简化模组配置，快速调整其行为与外观。</li>\n<li><strong>NBT编辑器</strong>：通过 \"/ftblibrary nbtedit\" 命令访问强大的NBT编辑器，可直接在用户友好的GUI中修改方块实体、实体或玩家的NBT数据。</li>\n<li><strong>实用命令</strong>：FTB Library 提供 \"/ftblibrary night\" 和 \"/ftblibrary day\" 控制游戏时间，及 \"/ftblibrary rain\" 控制降雨等便捷命令，简化游戏操作。</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>示例GUI</strong></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-library/map-gui-preview.webp\" alt=\"\"></strong></p><p><strong>可扩展的侧边栏按钮</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>FTB Library 支持其他模组通过JSON文件创建侧边栏按钮，增强FTB模组的整体功能与灵活性。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-library/sidebar-preview.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>注意</strong>：虽然FTB Library并非为非FTB模组设计，但并未明确禁止使用。选择将其集成到此类项目中的开发者应做好应对潜在挑战的准备。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em>请谨慎操作，并对可能出现的任何兼容性或集成问题承担全部责任。您可以通过我们的GitHub问题页面报告错误或功能请求。</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>支持</h2><ul>\n<li>关于<strong>整合包</strong>问题，请访问：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-modpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-modpack</a></li>\n<li>关于<strong>模组</strong>问题，请访问：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-mod-issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-mod-issues</a></li>\n<li>有问题想咨询？加入我们的Discord：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/discord</a></li>\n</ul><hr><h2>保持关注</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-discord.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fgithub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-github.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitter-x.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fyoutube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-youtube.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitch.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252finstagram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-instagram.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ffacebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-facebook.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftiktok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-tiktok.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
